{"url":"https://www.marines.mil/Force-Design/Priorities/Article/2708120/expeditionary-advanced-base-operations-eabo/","claim":"EABO以低足迹、机动、拒止环境下前沿展开为约束,防御生存性取决于暴露最小化与对远程打击的规避。"},
{"url":"https://media.defense.gov/2024/Dec/05/2003599149/-1/-1/0/FACT-SHEET-STRATEGY-FOR-COUNTERING-UNMANNED-SYSTEMS.PDF","claim":"美方以分层多域方式反无人系统,并将规模化、自主化无人威胁演进作为C-UAS战略设计依据。"},
